    "chunk_text": "Lot No. 01, 02, 03, 04, 05, 06Name of Land: Kiriporuwa Part II; Claimants Name andAddress: 01. Lands Reform Commission No. 475, KaduwelaRoad, Battaramulla. 02. Managing Director Kegalle PlantationsPLC No. 310, High-level Road, Maharagama. 03. Ministry ofPlantation Industries Second Floor, Sethsiripaya, Stage II,Battaramulla; Extent: 1.8729 Hectares.\n\nDate of examinations for claims of compensation:\n\nFor Lots No. 06, 07 in P.P.L. No. 3679 on 15th October, 2019at 10.00 a.m.\n\nAll persons interested in the aforesaid land are herebyrequired to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized inwriting, before me at Divisional Secretariat, Bulathkohupitiyaon 05th October, 2019 at 10.00 a.m.\n\nFurther, it should be notified in writing (in duplicated) before15th October, 2019 regarding the nature of their interests inthe land/lands, the particulars of their claims for compensationfor acquisition of the said land the amount of compensationand the details of computation of such amount.\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA.\n\nJ. M. RAMYA JAYASUNDARA,Divisional Secretary/Land Acquiring Officer,\n\nDivisional Secretariat\n\nBulathkohupitiya.\n\nAt Divisional Secretariat,Bulathkohupitiya,04th September, 2019.\n\n09 - 860"
