    "chunk_text": "IV ^wd& jeks fldgi \u2013 YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'08'31Part IV (B) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 31.08.20191A\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2140$52 - 2019 iema;e\u00efn\u00be ui 12 jeks n%yiam;skaod - 2019'09'12No. 2140/52 - THURSDAY SEPTEMBER 12, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nFILLING OF A VACANCY IN THE OFFICE OF MEMBER OF THE COLOMBO MUNICIPALCOUNCIL UNDER SECTION 66A(1) OF THE LOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONS ORDINANCE(CHAPTER 262)\n\nWHEREAS the office of the return member of Colombo Municipal Council has fallen vacant by reason of ceased to bea member of the party ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the United Peace Alliance, the recognized political party to which MohomadMasahir Mohomad Binkas the member belonged, was required by me under Section 66 A (1) of the aforesaid ordinance,to decide upon returned member of United Peace Alliance who belongs to such party and is not disqualified underSection 9 of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance and who shall be declared selected as a member within a periodof thirty (30) days ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the aforesaid recognized Political Party has communicated his decision tonominate Cadar Mohideen Mohamed Nizamdeen to fill such vacancy ;\n\nNOW THEREFORE, I, Pathiraja Arachchillage Sunil Senaratne, Returning Officer of the Colombo MunicipalCouncil, acting in terms of Section 66A(1) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262) do hereby declarethat Cadar Mohideen Mohamed Nizamdeen was selected as the member of the Colombo Municipal Council.\n\nP. A. S. SENARATNE,Returning Officer,Colombo Municipal Council.District Election Office,Colombo City,10th September, 2019.\n\n09 - 911\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART IV (B) \u2014 LOCAL GOVERNMENT\n\nNotices under the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance"
