    "chunk_text": "I fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'09'12PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 12.09.20191A\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2140$57 - 2019 iema;e\u00efn\u00be ui 12 jeks n%yiam;skaod - 2019'09'12No. 2140/57 - THURSDAY, SEPTEMBER 12, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART I : SECTION (I) \u2014 GENERAL\n\nGovernment Notifications\n\nFILLING OF A VACANCY UNDER PARAGRAPH 13(b) OF ARTICLE 99 OF THE CONSTITUTIONOF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA\n\nWHEREAS the Secretary General of Parliament has informed the Election Commission, under Section 64(1) of theParliamentary Elections Act, No. 1 of 1981, as amended by the Act, No. 15 of 1988, that a vacancy has occurred in themembership of the Eighth Parliament by reason of death of Mr. Gajadeera Vidhanearachchige Bans Chandrasiri, who wasdeclared elected as a Member of Parliament for the Electoral District No. 8 - Matara under Section 62 of the aforesaidAct.\n\nAND WHEREAS the Returning Officer, for the electoral district which returned the said member was directedby the Election Commission under Section 64(1) of the aforesaid Act to fill this vacancy as provided for under paragraph13(b) of Article 99 of the Constitution.\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Returning Officer acting under Section 64(2) of the aforesaid Act has made a return inForm \u201cM\u201d set out in the First Schedule to the aforesaid Act, to the effect that Mr. Manoj Prasanga Hewagampalage wasdeclared elected as a Member of Parliament for the said electoral district.\n\nNOW THEREFORE, we, the Election Commission, in the exercise of the powers vested in the ElectionCommission by Section 64(2) of the Parliamentary Elections Act, No. 1 of 1981 which shall be read with the provisions\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk1A - G 30913\u2014 387 (09/2019)"
