    "chunk_text": "wxl 2141$4 - 2019 iema;e\u00efn\u00be ui 16 jeks i\u00f7od - 2019'09'16No. 2141/4 \u2013 MONDAY, SEPTEMBER 16, 2019\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nYS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nG 30985 - 32 (2019/09) This Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www. documents.gov.lk\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nMy Reference No.: 3/2/3/10/270.Land Ministry Reference No: 4-3/9/2016/Ws/395.\n\nI hereby give notice, under Section 7 Sub-section (1) of theLand Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition(Amendment) Act, No.28 of 1964, that the Governmentintends to acquire the following lands, which is required fora public Purpose:\n\nThe public purpose:\u2013 Land acquisition for the Entry Road,which is combining intake pump house and Water Treatmentplant under Gampaha, Attanagalla, Minuwangoda intergratedWater Supply Scheme.\n\nDescription of the Land to be Acquired:\n\nAn allotment of Land, mentioned in the plan bearingNo: Mu.Pi.Gam. 4146 prepared by Senior Superintendent ofSurveyor Gampaha instead of Surveyor General dated27.05.2019 situated in the Village of Karasnagala inKarasnagala - South Grama Niladhari Division, No. 365 C, inAttanagalla Divisional Secretarial area in Gampaha District,Western Province bounded as below:\n\n1. Lot No. 01Name of the Land: Baludangolla Kele; Description of Land:A Rubber Plantation aged About 10 - 20 years; Owner:Government; First Owners: P.V. Anulawathi and P.V.Chandrawathi resided in Nikahatikanda, Thunokinda,Baludangollawaththa; Extend: 0.0467 Hectare.\n\n2. Lot No. 02Name of the Land: Baludangolla Kele; Description of Land:A Rubber Plantation aged About 10 - 20 years; Owner:Government; First Owners: P.V. Padmasiri Wijethunga residedin Nikahatikanda, Thunokinda, Baludangollawaththa; Extend:0.0439 Hectare."
