    "chunk_size_bytes": 2133,
    "chunk_text": "The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2141/9 - 2019 \u0dc3\u0dd0\u0217\u0dad\u0dd0\u023c\u0db6\u0259 \u0db8\u0dc3 17 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u0d85\u0d9f\u0dc4\u025e\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf - 2019.09.17\n\nNo. 2141/9 \u2013 TUESDAY, SEPTEMBER 17, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice Under Section 7\n\nD. S.\u2019s Reference . No.: ELDS/LND/04/ACQ/2014-06.\n\nLand Ministry\u2019s Reference No.: 4-3/8/2016/HA/284. I hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the land Acquisition Act, as amended by Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following land/servitude which is required for a public purpose.\n\nDescription of the Land to be acquired :\n\nSituated in the Village of Kahawatta in the Grama Niladhari Division of Kahawatta (189A), in Pallepaththu of the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Elapatha, in Ratnapura District, Sabaragamuwa Province.\n\nPlan No. F. V. P. 58, Supplement No. 11, Sheet No. 12.\n\nLot No. 232 - Name of the land: Gangagawawatta; Extent: 0.0126 Hectare.\n\nBounded by North : Lot No. 9; East : Lot No. 9; South: Lot No. 9; West: Lot No. 9.\n\nClaimed by: Konara Mudiyanselage Subasinghe, Kahawatta, Dambuluwana.\n\nAll persons interested in the aforesaid land/servitude are hereby required to appear personally, or by agent duly authorized in writing, before me at the Divisional Secretariat, Elapatha at 10.30 a. m. On the 16th day of December 2019.\n\nFurther, they should notify me in writing and in duplicate before the 09th December 2019, the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land/servitude, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount. Documents should be submitted to me on the same date to prove the interests.\n\n. gfg S. A. DILRUK, Divisional Secretary, Elapatha.\n\nAt the Divisional Secretariat, Elapatha, On the 12th day of September 2019.\n\n10-29\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk"
