    "chunk_text": "IV ^wd& jeks fldgi \u2013 YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'06'03Part IV (B) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 03.06.20191A\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2141$10 - 2019 iema;e\u00efn\u00be ui 17 jeks w\u00d5yrejdod - 2019'09'17No. 2141/10 - TUESDAY SEPTEMBER 17, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nFILLING OF A VACANCY IN THE OFFICE OF MEMBER OF THE PANVILA PRADESHIYASABHA UNDER SECTION 66A(1) OF THE LOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONS ORDINANCE(CHAPTER 262)\n\nWHEREAS the office of the return member of Panvila Pradeshiya Sabha has fallen vacant by reason of ceased to bemember of the party ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the United Progressive Alliance (Democratic People\u2019s Front at Present), therecognized political party to which Suppaiya Uma Saraswathi the member belonged, was required by me under Section66 A (1) of the aforesaid ordinance, to decide upon returned member of United Progressive Alliance (DemocraticPeople\u2019s Front at Present), who belongs to such party and is not disqualified under Section 9 of the Local AuthoritiesElections Ordinance and who shall be declared selected as a member within a period of thirty (30) days ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the aforesaid recognized Political Party has communicated his decision tonominate Soosai Vijayamala to fill such vacancy ;\n\nNOW THEREFORE, I, Talangama Appuhamilage Chaminda Namal Talangama, Returning Officer of the PanvilaPradeshiya Sabha, acting in terms of Section 66A(1) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262) dohereby declare that Soosai Vijayamala was selected as the member of the Panvila Pradeshiya Sabha.\n\nT. A. C. N. TALANGAMA,Returning Officer,Panvila Pradeshiya Sabha.District Election Office,Kandy,12th September, 2019.\n\n10 - 30\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART IV (B) \u2014 LOCAL GOVERNMENT\n\nNotices under the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance"
