    "chunk_text": "IV ^wd& jeks fldgi \u2013 YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'06'03Part IV (B) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 03.06.20191A\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2141$11 - 2019 iema;e\u00efn\u00be ui 17 jeks w\u00d5yrejdod - 2019'09'17No. 2141/11 - TUESDAY SEPTEMBER 17, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nFILLING OF A VACANCY IN THE OFFICE OF MEMBER OF THE DEHIWALA - MOUNTLAVINIA MUNICIPAL COUNCIL UNDER SECTION 66A(1) OF THE LOCAL AUTHORITIESELECTIONS ORDINANCE (CHAPTER 262)\n\nWHEREAS the office of return member of Dehiwala - Mount Lavinia Municipal Council has fallen vacant by reason ofResignation ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the People\u2019s Liberation Front, the recognized political party to which S. W.N. Danuska Silva the member belonged, was required by me under Section 66 A (1) of the aforesaid ordinance, to decideupon returned member of People\u2019s Liberation Front, who belongs to such party and is not disqualified under Section 9 ofthe Local Authorities Elections Ordinance and who shall be declared selected as a member within a period of thirty (30)days ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the aforesaid recognized Political Party has communicated his decision tonominate K. Premasiri to fill such vacancy ;\n\nNOW THEREFORE, I, Pathiraja Arachchillage Sunil Senaratne, Returning Officer of the Dehiwala - MountLavinia Municipal Council, acting in terms of Section 66A(1) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter262) do hereby declare that K. Premasiri was selected as the member of the Dehiwala - Mount Lavinia Municipal Council.\n\nP. A. S. SENARATNE,Returning Officer,Dehiwala - Mount Lavinia Municipal Council.District Election Office,Colombo City,16th September, 2019.\n\n10 - 31\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART IV (B) \u2014 LOCAL GOVERNMENT\n\nNotices under the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance"
