    "chunk_text": "2AI fldgi: (I) fPoh \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2019'09'17PART I: SEC. (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 17.09.2019\n\nMy No.: IR/COM/01/2018/151.\n\nMr. N.V.F. Koraya, No. 37/1, Udyana Mawatha, Mahara, Nugegoda, Kadawatha of the one part\n\nand\n\nCeylon Petroleum Corporation, No. 609, Dr. Danister de Silva Mawatha, Colombo 09 of the other part.\n\nSTATEMENT OF MATTER IN DISPUTE\n\nThe matter in dispute between the aforesaid parties is \u2013\n\nWhether Mr. N.V.F.Koraya who worked in the Post of Security Assistant at the Ceylon Petroleum Corporation has been caused injusticeby not being given arrears of salary, salary increments, bonuses and other entitlements, if any for the period from 17.03.2005 to 20.08.2007,the period during which he had been interdicted and if so, to what relief he is entitled.\n\nA. WIMALAWEERA,Commissioner General of Labour.\n\nDated at the Office of the Commissioner General of Labour,Colombo this 31st day of July, 2019.\n\n09 - 693\n\nMy No.: IR/COM/03/H/2014/98^Wm&'\n\nTHE INDUSTRIAL DISPUTES ACT, CHAPTER 131 OF THE LEGISLATIVE ENACTMENTS OF CEYLON( 1956 REVISED EDITION)\n\nOrder under Section 4(1)\n\nWHEREAS AN Industrial Dispute in respect of the matter specified in the statement of the Commissioner General of Labour whichaccompanies this order exists between \u2013\n\nMr. D.M.Lal Wasantha Kumara, Kirawana Ulpatha, Beramada, Hali-ela of the one part\n\nand\n\nSri Lanka Transport Board, No. 200, Kirula Road, Colombo 05 of the other part."
