nd Lot No. 3; West: Block 5.\n\n02. Lot No. 02 - Total extent of about 0.2571 Hectare\n\nNorth: Lot No. 1; East: Block 1; South: Block 1 and Lot No. 1; West: Lot No. 1.\n\nClaimant's Name and Address: Land Reform Commission, No. 475, Kaduwela Road, Baththaramulla."
