    "chunk_text": "I fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'09'18PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 18.09.20191A\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2141$50 - 2019 iema;e\u00efn\u00be ui 18 jeks nodod - 2019'09'18No. 2141/50 - WEDNESDAY, SEPTEMBER 18, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART I : SECTION (I) \u2014 GENERALGovernment Notifications\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A G 31004\u2014 20 (09/2019)\n\nTHE GAZETTE TO AMEND THE EXTRAORDINARY GAZETTE NOTIFICATION OF THEDEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA BEARING No. 2133/4 DATED 22ND JULY, 2019\n\nI, Patali Champika Ranawaka, Minister of Megapolis and Western Development by virtue of the powers vested in meunder the Urban Development Authority Law do hereby amend the Gazette Notification bearing No. 2133/4 dated 22ndJuly, 2019 by inserting immediately after the list of appointees thereof, the following subsections to have a uniformeffect as the principle Gazette Notification :\n\n1. The Advisory Committee shall be empowered to perform and discharge all duties and functions pertaining toadvising the Minister on the given subject and those incidental thereto as given hereunder by exercising duediligence ;\n\n(a) Carrying out comprehensive inquiries on the demands for housing facilities with special needs\n\n(b) Providing appropriate recommendations as and when required\n\n(c) Entertaining requisitions made by applicants under the Urban Regeneration Project, implemented by theUrban Development Authority under the umbrella of the Ministry of Megapolis & Western Development\n\n2. It shall be the duty of the Advisory Committee to tender advice on the future direction and strategy to the Ministerand make its recommendations thereon."
