    "chunk_text": "IV ^wd& jeks fldgi \u2013 YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'06'03Part IV (B) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 03.06.20191A\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2141$74 - 2019 iema;e\u00efn\u00be ui 19 jeks n%yiam;skaod - 2019'09'19No. 2141/74 - THURSDAY SEPTEMBER 19, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nFILLING OF A VACANCY IN THE OFFICE OF MEMBER OF THE PANDUWASNUWARAPRADESHIYA SABHA UNDER SECTION 66A(1) OF THE LOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONSORDINANCE (CHAPTER 262)\n\nWHEREAS the office of return member of Panduwasnuwara Pradeshiya Sabha has fallen vacant by reason of Death ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the United National Party, the recognized political party to which YapaMudiyanselage Somarathne the member belonged, was required by me under Section 66 A (1) of the aforesaid ordinance,to decide upon returned member of United National Party who belongs to such party and is not disqualified under Section9 of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance and who shall be declared selected as a member within a period of thirty(30) days ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the aforesaid recognized Political Party has communicated his decision tonominate Panambara Mudiyanselage Kumarasena Jayalath to fill such vacancy ;\n\nNOW THEREFORE, I, Gamalathge Dilip Nishantha, Returning Officer of the Panduwasnuwara PradeshiyaSabha, acting in terms of Section 66A(1) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262) do hereby declarethat Panambara Mudiyanselage Kumarasena Jayalath was selected as the member of the Panduwasnuwara PradeshiyaSabha.\n\nGAMALATHGE DILIP NISHANTHA,Returning Officer,Panduwasnuwara Pradeshiya Sabha.District Election Office,Kurunegala,18th September, 2019.\n\n10 - 122\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART IV (B) \u2014 LOCAL GOVERNMENT\n\nNotices under the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance"
