    "chunk_text": "The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0dc1\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u0dba\u0dca \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2141/75 - 2019 \u0dc3\u0dd0\u0db4\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd0\u0db8\u0dca\u0db6\u0dbb\u0dca \u0db8\u0dc3 20 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0db1\u0dd2 \u0dc3\u0dd2\u0d9a\u0dd4\u0dbb\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf - 2019.09.20\n\nNo. 2141/75\u2013 FRIDAY, SEPTEMBER, 20, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nTHE MORTGAGE ACT\n\nBY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 3 (c) and Section 114 (2) of the Mortgage Act (Chapter 89), I, Aluthgama Gamaladdalage Nimal Karunatilake, Actg. Director General of Commerce, do by this notification declare, the institution specified in the schedule hereto to be an \u201cApproved Credit Agency\u201d for the purposess of this Act, with effect from 16th September 2019. NIMAL KARUNATILAKE, Actg. Director General of Commerce. Colombo, 17th September 2019.\n\nSCHEDULE Trade Finance & Investments PLC\n\nTHE TRUST RECEIPTS ORDINANCE\n\nBY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 6 of the Trust Receipts Ordinance No. 12 of 1947 as amended by No. 13 of 1990, I, Aluthgama Gamaladdalage Nimal Karunatilake, Actg. Director General of Commerce, do by this notification declare, the institution specified in the Schedule hereto to be \u201can \u201cApproved Credit Agency\u201d for the purposes of this Ordinance, with effect from 16th September 2019. NIMAL KARUNATILAKE, Actg. Director General of Commerce. Colombo, 17th September 2019.\n\n(Published by Authority) PART I : SECTION (I) \u2014 GENERAL\n\nGovernment Notifications\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A - G 31027 - 12 (2019/09)\n\n2 A I \u0dd9\u0d9a\u0ddc\u0da7\u0dc3 : (I) \u0dd9\u0da2\u0daf\u0dba - \u0